{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52103","headline":"五言奉和咏棋应诏 二 · 刘子翼","name":"五言奉和咏棋应诏 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鋭心争决胜，运功□图全。\n眼均须执後，气等欲乘先。\n引行遥下雁，徇地远侵边。\n借问逢仙日，[何]如偶圣年？\n（《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗原署「承议郎守着作郎弘文馆学士刘子翼上」。\n张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘子翼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}